"<b>1 Resolve</b>: beasts that are aggro on you, in whose zone you stand, or next to you act. <b>2 Choice</b>: take 2 coin (safe) or draw an arena card (instant cards resolve at once and can hurt). <b>3 Action</b>: move, up to one attack per arm, push, topple, loot, trade and spend CF. <b>4 End</b>.":"<b>1 结算</b>：对你有仇恨、你站在其区域内或在你旁边的野兽行动。<b>2 选择</b>：拿2金币（安全）或抽一张竞技场卡牌（即时卡立即生效，可能造成伤害）。<b>3 行动</b>：移动、每只手臂最多攻击一次、推动、推倒、搜刮、交易和花费CF。<b>4 结束</b>。",
"<b>1 Resolve</b>: beasts that are aggro on you, in whose zone you stand, or next to you act. <b>2 Choice</b>: take {0} (safe) or draw an arena card (instant cards resolve at once and can hurt). <b>3 Action</b>: move, up to one attack per arm, push, topple, loot, trade and spend CF. <b>4 End</b>.":"<b>1 结算</b>：对你有仇恨、你站在其区域内或在你旁边的野兽行动。<b>2 选择</b>：拿取{0}（安全）或抽一张竞技场卡牌（即时卡立即生效，可能造成伤害）。<b>3 行动</b>：移动、每只手臂最多攻击一次、推动、推倒、搜刮、交易和花费CF。<b>4 结束</b>。",
