"<b>Accept invitations you can win.</b> The stars are honest: a ★★★ Leptis Cup is a fine first trophy; the ★★★★★ Colossus draws the league's best. Two fighters in the Colossus means two heats with a chance — they never meet in round one.":"<b>接受你能赢的邀请。</b>星级很诚实：★★★的Leptis Cup是不错的第一座奖杯；★★★★★的Colossus会吸引联赛最强者。两名斗士参加Colossus意味着两场有机会的预赛 — 他们在第一轮绝不会相遇。",
"<b>Action</b>: attack first if a kill or pot is in reach, then move; you get one attack per arm. Diagonals cost 2 movement.":"<b>行动</b>：如果能击杀或打到陶罐就先攻击，再移动；每只手臂可攻击一次。斜向移动消耗2点移动力。",
"<b>Age shapes class</b>: the young arrive mostly as Slaves and Soldiers; the graying re-badge as Veteranus. Mid-career (23–31) is when fighters most often change class — at a ludus's request, after new drills, on an omen-reader's advice, or plain restlessness. The news criers report every change.":"<b>年龄影响职业</b>：年轻人多以Slave和Soldier身份到来；年长者会改换为Veteranus。职业中期（23–31岁）是斗士最常更换职业的时候 — 应某个ludus的要求、在新训练之后、听从占卜师的建议，或者只是心生躁动。传令官会报道每一次更换。",
"<b>All set in Your ludus.</b> Match Week is waiting at <b>{0}</b>.":"<b>你的Ludus已准备就绪。</b>比赛周在<b>{0}</b>等着你。",
