"<b>Bench</b> fighters train, or go on loan to a friendly house for a weekly fee. Rivals never get a loan.":"<b>替补</b>斗士进行训练，或按周收费租借给友好家族。绝不租借给宿敌。",
"<b>Bet on value, not favorites.</b> Scouted fighters show your own estimate beside the bookmaker's; ▲ value marks the only bets worth making. Every slip lands in the shared exchange, so you can see who else is laying coin.":"<b>押价值，不押热门。</b>侦察过的斗士会在庄家赔率旁显示你自己的估算；▲ 价值标记是唯一值得下的注。每张注单都会进入共享交易所，你能看到还有谁在下注。",
"<b>Big crowds cheer louder, not richer.</b> Up to 8 seated, every fan in your section is 1 CF (the printed rule). Over 8, your section is worth its share of the house (fans × 8 ÷ attendance), fractions carry turn to turn, and no section pays more than 3 CF per resolve — so packing the stands with your fans helps, but freedom still has to be won with trophies and the final bout. Attendance is recorded with every result.":"<b>观众多只是更响，不是更富。</b>不超过8人就座时，你区域里每位粉丝值1 CF（印刷规则）。超过8人时，你的区域按其在全场的占比计算（粉丝 × 8 ÷ 观众人数），零头逐回合累积，且每次结算任何区域都不会给超过3 CF——所以让你的粉丝坐满看台有帮助，但自由仍得靠奖杯和最后一战去赢。每次结果都会记录观众人数。",
"<b>Big crowds cheer louder, not richer.</b> Up to 8 seated, every fan in your section is {0} (the printed rule). Over 8, your section is worth its share of the house (fans × 8 ÷ attendance), fractions carry turn to turn, and no section pays more than {1} per resolve — so packing the stands with your fans helps, but freedom still has to be won with trophies and the final bout. Attendance is recorded with every result.":"<b>观众多只会欢呼更响，不会更值钱。</b>座位不超过8人时，你区域的每位粉丝为{0}（印刷规则）。超过8人时，你的区域按其占全场的比例计算（粉丝 × 8 ÷ 到场人数），小数逐回合累积，每次结算任何区域支付都不超过{1} — 所以让你的粉丝挤满看台有帮助，但自由仍要靠战利品和最后一战赢得。每个结果都会记录到场人数。",
