"<b>Drill</b>: set the Training Yard; no Match Week means no wear on top of the work.":"<b>训练</b>：安排训练场；没有比赛周，训练之外就没有额外损耗。",
"<b>Early billing is a small, safe edge.</b> +10 coin and +1 fame just for planning; the 15% poster bonus only if they win. Bill a steady fighter for a week whose fixture suits them.":"<b>提前造势是小而稳的优势。</b>只要做好计划就有+10金币和+1名望；15%的海报奖金只在获胜时发放。挑一周赛程适合他的时候，为一名稳定的斗士造势。",
"<b>Early billing is a small, safe edge.</b> {0} and +1 fame just for planning; the 15% poster bonus only if they win. Bill a steady fighter for a week whose fixture suits them.":"<b>提前挂牌是小而稳的优势。</b>只要做好计划就有{0}和+1名望；15%的海报奖金只在获胜时发放。为赛程合适的那一周挂上一名稳定的斗士。",
"<b>End the week.</b> Wages are paid, fighters train and heal, contracts tick down, and the <b>Acta Diurna</b> prints the week's news.":"<b>结束本周。</b>支付薪水，斗士训练和养伤，合同倒计时推进，<b>Acta Diurna</b>刊印本周新闻。",
"<b>Enter a fighter every week.</b> The appearance fee is paid win or lose, so an entry is never a loss even before the purse.":"<b>每周都派一名斗士参赛。</b>出场费无论输赢都会支付，所以哪怕还没算奖金，参赛也绝不会亏。",
"<b>Every card</b><span>The 70-card arena deck, round-2 cards, Mandata Flavi, Carmina, class and event cards, the Fates.</span>":"<b>全部卡牌</b><span>70张竞技场牌库、第2回合卡牌、Mandata Flavi、Carmina、职业与赛事卡、Fates。</span>",
"<b>Every gladiator has five ratings</b> from 50 to 99. Classes set the loadout; the ratings set the perks. A Slave tends to be fast and a Soldier strong, but not every one is.":"<b>每名角斗士都有五项属性</b>，范围50到99。职业决定装备组；属性决定特长。Slave往往速度快，Soldier往往力量强，但并非个个如此。",
"<b>FLAVIUS<br>RULE</b><small>×{0}</small>":"<b>FLAVIUS<br>RULE</b><small>×{0}</small>",
"<b>Facilities are where big winnings belong.</b> The Training yard, Valetudinarium, Barracks, Armory and Practice stands are permanent, cost 250 / 600 / 1200 a level, and set your Ludus grade — recruits weigh it, and each one works every single week.":"<b>大笔奖金该花在设施上。</b>训练场、Valetudinarium、营房、军械库和练习看台都是永久的，每级花费250 / 600 / 1200，并决定你的Ludus评级——新人会看重它，而且每一项每周都在发挥作用。",
"<b>Fates in the league.</b> Every league bout ends the way a board-game event does: each fighter meets the <b>Fate table</b> (p.54-55). Under 17 CF they are condemned (Damnatio or a Fatal Charade); 17-19 CF, the <b>Thumb of Flavius</b> — you roll the d6 yourself on Match Week (4-6 spares them, 1-3 hands them to a d12 death); 20-49 CF, the <b>Ludus Flavius</b> — they survive; 50+ CF, the <b>rudis</b> — freedom, theirs to take (you can ask them to stay). Any condemned fighter can be bought back with <b>blood money</b> paid to the editor — the price rises with their rating, fame and how grim the sentence. (A <b>missio</b>, in Flavius Rule, is something else entirely: a five-event campaign for one gladiator — see New event → Missio.)":"<b>联赛中的Fates。</b>每场联赛比赛都像桌游赛事一样结束：每名斗士都要面对<b>Fate表</b>（第54-55页）。低于17 CF会被定罪（Damnatio或Fatal Charade）；17-19 CF，交给<b>Thumb of Flavius</b> — 你在比赛周亲自掷d6（4-6饶命，1-3则交给d12决定死法）；20-49 CF，进入<b>Ludus Flavius</b> — 他们存活；50+ CF，获得<b>rudis</b> — 自由，由他们选择（你可以请他们留下）。任何被定罪的斗士都可以用付给主办者的<b>血钱</b>赎回 — 价格随其属性、名望和判决的严酷程度上涨。（在Flavius Rule中，<b>missio</b>是完全不同的东西：为一名角斗士设计的五场赛事征程 — 见新赛事 → Missio。）",
"<b>Fates in the league.</b> Every league bout ends the way a board-game event does: each fighter meets the <b>Fate table</b> (p.54-55). Under {0} they are condemned (Damnatio or a Fatal Charade); 17-19 CF, the <b>Thumb of Flavius</b> — you roll the d6 yourself on Match Week (4-6 spares them, 1-3 hands them to a d12 death); 20-49 CF, the <b>Ludus Flavius</b> — they survive; 50+ CF, the <b>rudis</b> — freedom, theirs to take (you can ask them to stay). Any condemned fighter can be bought back with <b>blood money</b> paid to the editor — the price rises with their rating, fame and how grim the sentence. (A <b>missio</b>, in Flavius Rule, is something else entirely: a five-event campaign for one gladiator — see New event → Missio.)":"<b>联赛中的Fates。</b>每场联赛比赛都像桌游赛事一样结束：每名斗士都要面对<b>Fate表</b>（第54-55页）。低于{0}会被定罪（Damnatio或Fatal Charade）；17-19 CF，交给<b>Thumb of Flavius</b> — 你在比赛周亲自掷d6（4-6饶命，1-3则交给d12决定死法）；20-49 CF，进入<b>Ludus Flavius</b> — 他们存活；50+ CF，获得<b>rudis</b> — 自由，由他们选择（你可以请他们留下）。任何被定罪的斗士都可以用付给主办者的<b>血钱</b>赎回 — 价格随其属性、名望和判决的严酷程度上涨。（在Flavius Rule中，<b>missio</b>是完全不同的东西：为一名角斗士设计的五场赛事征程 — 见新赛事 → Missio。）",
"<b>Fell behind the empire?</b> The doctores can run the missing weeks with sensible verdicts — or keep your own calendar if you'd rather play every week yourself.":"<b>落后于帝国了？</b>doctores可以用合理的裁决补跑缺失的几周——如果你更愿意每周亲自打，也可以保留你自己的日历。",
"<b>Festivals</b> (p.42) chain three events: Carmina Fescennina, a Chariot Race with no PvP (finishing order sets the next turn order), then a Classic Elimination. Coin and CF carry across; the highest CF at the end is crowned champion (+5 CF).":"<b>节庆</b>（第42页）串联三场赛事：Carmina Fescennina、一场没有PvP的战车比赛（完赛顺序决定下一场的回合顺序），然后是一场Classic Elimination。金币和CF会延续；最后CF最高者加冕为冠军（+5 CF）。",
"<b>Festivals</b> (p.42) chain three events: Carmina Fescennina, a Chariot Race with no PvP (finishing order sets the next turn order), then a Classic Elimination. Coin and CF carry across; the highest CF at the end is crowned champion ({0}).":"<b>节庆</b>（第42页）串联三场赛事：Carmina Fescennina、一场没有PvP的战车比赛（完赛顺序决定下一场的回合顺序），然后是一场Classic Elimination。金币和CF会延续；最后CF最高者加冕为冠军（{0}）。",
"<b>Fight.</b> <b>Match Week</b> is Flavius's travelling games. It brings three bouts to a city: the Undercard on Friday, the Feature on Saturday and the Main event on Sunday. Enter your starters, then fight, watch or simulate each bout.":"<b>作战。</b><b>比赛周</b>是Flavius的巡回角斗。它为一座城市带来三场比赛：周五的暖场赛、周六的焦点赛和周日的主赛事。让你的首发报名，然后亲自作战、观看或模拟每一场比赛。",
