"<b>Hot seat: turn the board</b>":"<b>Hot seat：转动棋盘</b>",
"<b>How fighters enter the league</b>: two or three new faces arrive every week (mostly rookies, 17–21, low-rated but high-potential and cheap); your arena's saved Ludus Flavius gladiators and Creator Studio characters join every new career; and a bout short of entrants conscripts a fresh sword on the spot.":"<b>斗士如何加入联赛</b>：每周有两三张新面孔到来（多为17–21岁的新手，属性低但潜力高且便宜）；你的竞技场中保存的Ludus Flavius角斗士和创作工坊角色会加入每个新生涯；而参赛者不足的比赛会当场征召一名新剑手。",
"<b>How the grades are reckoned.</b> Coin grades your treasury, generosity and betting; Glory your fame and win rate; Honor your personality minus every poach and broken contract; Spectacle your showmanship and fame; Training your discipline and how many fighters you have improved; Arena time how crowded your stable is. Home depends on each fighter's city.":"<b>各项评分如何计算。</b>金币看你的金库、慷慨程度和下注；荣耀看名望和胜率；荣誉看你的性格减去每次挖角和毁约；场面看表演力和名望；训练看纪律以及你提升过多少斗士；出场机会看你的角斗士团有多拥挤。家乡取决于每名斗士的城市。",
"<b>How they leave</b>: death under the thumb; two severed limbs (unless healed by Hygeia); a cheap free agent who goes unsigned ~14 weeks gives up and goes home; and <b>age</b> — every season is a birthday, and past 35 each year makes hanging up the sword likelier.":"<b>他们如何离开</b>：死于拇指之下；失去两条肢体（除非由Hygeia治愈）；廉价的自由斗士约14周无人签约便放弃回家；还有<b>年龄</b> — 每个赛季都是一个生日，过了35岁，每年挂剑退役的可能性都会增加。",
"<b>How tokens work.</b> Every class and default beast has a figure. Every <b>custom character</b> gets one automatically from its portrait (Creator Studio → Characters), and every <b>custom beast</b> wears the figure of its kind (a ready-made animal, or one drawn automatically for a custom kind) — pick either in <i>Token for</i> to sculpt it. You can also sculpt <b>free-standing library tokens</b> (📚 below) and hand them to any creation, here or from the character and beast editors. Tokens show on the board when Settings → Tokens is on <b>Figures</b>; your creations always wear theirs. {0}":"<b>标记如何运作。</b>每个职业和默认野兽都有一个形象。每个<b>自定义角色</b>都会根据其肖像自动获得一个（创作工坊 → 角色），每头<b>自定义野兽</b>都使用其种类的形象（现成的动物，或为自定义种类自动绘制的形象）——在<i>标记对象</i>中选择任一项即可雕塑它。你也可以雕塑<b>独立的库中标记</b>（下方📚），并在这里或角色与野兽编辑器中把它交给任何创作。当设置 → 标记为<b>人像</b>时，标记会显示在棋盘上；你的创作总会使用自己的标记。{0}",
"<b>Hygeia's Blessing</b>":"<b>Blessings of Hygeia</b>",
"<b>Hygeia's Blessing</b> heals your whole roster once a season, for free. Save it for a bad week near the run-in. Every house has one.":"<b>Blessings of Hygeia</b>每赛季免费治愈你的全队一次。把它留到赛季冲刺阶段的糟糕一周。每个家族都有一次。",
"<b>Imperium & the crowd</b><span>Named regulars with memories and tempers, fans on the roads, world events, weather and omens.</span>":"<b>帝国与观众</b><span>有记忆和脾气的常客、路上的粉丝、世界事件、天气和预兆。</span>",
"<b>Infamis & Hall</b><span>The monthly high-score table and the Hall of Flavius.</span>":"<b>Infamis与殿堂</b><span>每月高分榜和Flavius殿堂。</span>",
"<b>Intelligence</b> sets a CPU's mind — Novice below 65, Apprentice 65, Fighter 76, Veteran 86, Master 96. It never adds gear or coin.":"<b>智力</b>决定CPU的心智——低于65为新手，65为学徒，76为斗士，86为老手，96为大师。它从不增加装备或金币。",
"<b>Interpretations, simplifications and the card sheets</b>":"<b>诠释、简化与卡牌表</b>",
"<b>Invicta Gloria</b> · unconquered glory, painted in blood-red":"<b>Invicta Gloria</b> · 不败的荣耀，漆成血红",
"<b>Invitations are deadly now.</b> A heat winner rarely falls to the Fates (the winner's bonus lifts their score), but the rest of the field plays for its life. Send fighters you can afford to lose — or pick events marked Fate-free.":"<b>邀请赛现在可是要命的。</b>小组赛胜者很少倒在Fates手里（胜者加成会抬高分数），但其余参赛者是在拿命拼。派出你输得起的斗士——或者选择标明无Fate的赛事。",
