"<b>One of each, three pitches.</b> Each week you can scout, feast, gift, trial, pitch and make an offer to a recruit once each, with three pitches in total. Spread your hours across prospects instead of hammering one.":"<b>每样一次，游说三次。</b>每周你对每个新人可以侦察、宴请、送礼、试训、游说和报价各一次，游说总共三次。把时间分摊到多个人选上，而不是死磕一个。",
"<b>One word, one meaning:</b> the <b>editor</b> is the one who gives (pays for) the games — the rulebook's term. Flavius is the empire's great editor; win in a city and its own editor takes the box. A house's financial <b>backer</b> is money behind a ludus, not the games' host.":"<b>一词一义：</b><b>主办者</b>（editor）是出资举办比赛的人 — 这是规则书的用语。Flavius是帝国最伟大的主办者；在某座城市获胜后，那里自己的主办者会坐进包厢。家族的财务<b>后台</b>是一个ludus背后的金主，不是比赛的主办方。",
