"<b>Pay at least {0} coin this week</b>, or the next time one of your fighters steps onto the sand, someone in the stands will settle the account for us.":"<b>本周至少付{0}金币</b>，否则下次你的斗士踏上沙场时，看台上会有人替我们把账算清。",
"<b>Pay at least {0} this week</b>, or the next time one of your fighters steps onto the sand, someone in the stands will settle the account for us.":"<b>本周至少还{0}</b>，否则下次你的斗士踏上沙场时，看台上会有人替我们清账。",
"<b>Plan</b>: bill a fighter on the Season tab for a big bout three or more weeks out.":"<b>规划</b>：在赛季页为三周或更久之后的一场大比赛宣传一名斗士。",
"<b>Play for Legacy.</b> There is no forced ending: cups and Superbus crowns are worth the most, and retirement at a high tier is the closest thing to \"beating\" Manager mode.":"<b>为Legacy而战。</b>没有强制结局：奖杯和Superbus桂冠最有价值，在高档位退休是最接近「通关」经理模式的事。",
"<b>Points win seasons, fame wins recruits.</b> A win is 3, a runner-up finish 1. The top four go to the Superbus. Feature and main-event wins count the same as undercard wins, so entering every bout you can win matters more than chasing one big purse.":"<b>积分赢赛季，名望赢新人。</b>胜一场3分，第二名1分。前四名进入Superbus。焦点战和主赛事的胜利与垫场赛胜利同分，所以参加每一场你能赢的比赛，比追一笔大奖金更重要。",
"<b>Prepare.</b> <b>Roster</b> sets your starters. <b>Recruiting</b> signs free agents (you have 10 hours a week). <b>Training Yard</b> sets drills and spends your 10 training hours. <b>Infirmary</b> heals.":"<b>准备。</b><b>名册</b>设定你的首发。<b>招募</b>签下自由斗士（你每周有10小时）。<b>训练场</b>设定训练并使用你的10小时训练时间。<b>医务所</b>负责治疗。",
"<b>Push a fighter over a line</b>: the to-do list flags anyone a few points short of a band; a personal trainer or brutal drills that week can earn the perk before the next Match Week.":"<b>推斗士过线</b>：待办列表会标出离某个档位差几点的人；那一周请私人教练或进行严酷训练，可能在下个比赛周前赢得天赋。",
"<b>Raising your grades</b>: treasury and low greed raise Coin; wins and fame raise Glory and Spectacle; Discipline plus improved fighters raises Training; a small roster raises Arena time; and Honor is the slow one — poaches (−9) and broken pledges (−6) scar it, kept pledges (+3) heal it.":"<b>提升评级</b>：金库充足和低贪婪提升金币；胜利和名望提升荣耀与观赏性；纪律加上斗士进步提升训练；名单精简提升出场时间；而荣誉提升最慢 — 挖角（−9）和违背承诺（−6）会损害它，信守承诺（+3）会修复它。",
"<b>Raising your name</b>":"<b>提升你的名声</b>",
"<b>Ranked — Damnatio.</b> {0} dies and is struck from your roster for good, with {1} {2} and {3} piece{4} of gear{5}. This cannot be undone.{6}":"<b>Ranked——Damnatio。</b>{0}死去并被永久从名册中除名，连同{1} {2}和{3}件装备{4||}{5}。此操作不可撤销。{6}",
"<b>Ranked:</b> your gladiator is eliminated and <b>dies by Damnatio</b>. This cannot be undone.":"<b>Ranked：</b>你的角斗士被淘汰并<b>死于Damnatio</b>。此操作不可撤销。",
"<b>Rating fits armor and fills the purse.</b> Before the bout a fighter gets +1 AP for every 6 points above 62 (65 → +1, 74 → +2, 80 → +3, 86+ → +4-5) and +1 coin for every 5 points above 70 (75 → +1, 90 → +4). A 37 walks out bare with an empty purse; a 65 with one extra AP; an 85 with four AP, three coin and the Hard brain.":"<b>属性配护甲，也装满钱袋。</b>比赛前，斗士每超过62分6点得+1 AP（65 → +1，74 → +2，80 → +3，86+ → +4-5），每超过70分5点得+1金币（75 → +1，90 → +4）。37分的人光着身子、空着钱袋上场；65分多一点AP；85分则带着4 AP、3金币和Hard的头脑。",
"<b>Rating fits armor and fills the purse.</b> Before the bout a fighter gets +1 AP for every 6 points above 62 (65 → +1, 74 → +2, 80 → +3, 86+ → +4-5) and {0} for every 5 points above 70 (75 → +1, 90 → +4). A 37 walks out bare with an empty purse; a 65 with one extra AP; an 85 with four AP, three coin and the Hard brain.":"<b>属性决定护甲并充实奖金。</b>比赛前，斗士高于62每6点+1 AP（65 → +1，74 → +2，80 → +3，86+ → +4-5），高于70每5点得{0}（75 → +1，90 → +4）。37分的赤身空囊出场；65分多一点AP；85分有四点AP、三枚金币和困难级的头脑。",
"<b>Rating sets the brain.</b> Below 60 a fighter plays like an <b>Easy</b> CPU: noisy decisions, random card and coin choices, no truces, no clever tunnel play. 60-79 plays <b>Normal</b>. <b>80+</b> plays <b>Hard</b>: almost no noise, banks coin for the market, avoids the deck when hurt, uses tunnels and truces well.":"<b>属性决定头脑。</b>低于60的斗士像<b>Easy</b> CPU一样打：决策混乱，卡牌和金币随便选，不休战，不会巧用隧道。60-79打<b>Normal</b>。<b>80+</b>打<b>Hard</b>：几乎没有失误，为市场攒钱，受伤时避开牌库，善用隧道和休战。",
"<b>Ratings</b>":"<b>属性</b>",
"<b>Read the Consilium.</b> The Quaestor's runway is the number to watch: under three weeks of wages, stop signing and start entering.":"<b>读一读Consilium。</b>Quaestor的余粮周数是要盯紧的数字：不够三周薪水时，就停止签约、开始参赛。",
"<b>Read the chips</b> on each fighter panel: a gold chip is a perk earned; a glowing one is a top band (96+).":"<b>看懂徽章</b>：每个斗士面板上，金色徽章是已获得的天赋；发光的是顶级档位（96+）。",
