"<b>Rivalry is real.</b> Poach a stable, outbid a suitor or beat their fighters and that lanista runs hot: bitter rivals poach YOUR fighters first and bet against your entries. The League tab shows every feud.":"<b>宿怨是真的。</b>挖走一家的人、出价压过另一位追求者，或打败他们的斗士，那位lanista就会记恨：死敌会优先挖走你的斗士，并押注你的参赛者输。联赛页显示每一桩恩怨。",
