"<i>Behold!</i> I implore you all to embark on any daring quests of creativity one can devise, embracing even the most obscure ideas, for the wisdom gained on these paths shall surpass any mere creation.\n  In the year 2016, I set forth on a momentous journey that has forged the very essence of <i>Flavius Rule</i> as you now behold it. From humble beginnings, tiny sparks of inspiration ignited, propelling me into uncharted territories where new, exhilarating challenges awaited. As I now reach the culmination of this odyssey, should this game kindle even a flicker of entertainment, joy, or inspiration within a select few, I shall consider my mission triumphantly fulfilled, surpassing all initial aspirations.":"<i>看哪！</i>我恳请诸位踏上一切能想到的大胆创意征程，哪怕是最冷僻的想法也要拥抱，因为在这些道路上获得的智慧，将胜过任何单纯的创造。\n  2016年，我踏上了一段意义非凡的旅程，它铸就了你们如今所见的<i>Flavius Rule</i>的精髓。从卑微的起点开始，一点点微小的灵感火花被点燃，推动我进入未知的领域，那里有新的、令人振奋的挑战等待着我。如今这段奥德赛之旅即将圆满，倘若这款游戏能在哪怕少数几位心中点燃一丝娱乐、喜悦或灵感，我便认为自己的使命已凯旋完成，远超最初的一切期望。",
