"A <b>cohort</b> is a group bound by something — a duo with a bond (family, friends, master &amp; slave, co-workers, the Blood of Asclepius…), a team of four, a keeper and their beasts, a pack. Members come from <b>Your Play Now Gladiators</b> (the active roster) and from the beasts. A cohort can ride in a ⭐ special event, join the <b>arena deck</b> as a card, and be placed in any custom event. {0}":"<b>组合</b>是因某种关系结合的群体——有羁绊的双人组（家人、朋友、主人与奴隶、同事、the Blood of Asclepius……）、四人组、饲养者与其野兽、兽群。成员来自<b>你的立即游戏角斗士</b>（当前阵容）和野兽。组合可以参加⭐特别赛事，以卡牌形式加入<b>竞技场牌库</b>，也可以放进任何自定义赛事。{0}",
"A <b>game save</b> is a snapshot of everything this browser remembers: your Manager careers and their worlds, the Ludus and its fallen, missios, every custom character, beast, event and spectator, the crowd's regulars, the arenas' chronicles, the Hall, your settings and themes. Saves are kept in this browser; <b>download</b> one to keep it safe or move it to another device.":"<b>游戏存档</b>是此浏览器所记住一切的快照：你的经理生涯及其世界、Ludus及其阵亡者、missio、所有自定义角色、野兽、赛事和观众、观众中的常客、各竞技场的编年史、名人堂、你的设置和主题。存档保存在此浏览器中；<b>下载</b>一份以妥善保管或转移到其他设备。",
"A <b>roster set</b> decides which of your creations are in play — the way sports games let you build a custom roster. <b>Classic</b> (the printed game only) is the default for every new career and every New event; pick another set when you found a career or on the New event screen. Your creations start <b>unticked</b>: tick them tab by tab, then save the set.":"<b>名单组</b>决定你的哪些创作参与游戏 — 就像体育游戏让你自建阵容一样。<b>Classic</b>（仅限印刷版游戏）是每个新生涯和每场新赛事的默认设置；创立生涯时或在新赛事画面中可以选择其他组。你的创作一开始<b>未勾选</b>：逐个标签页勾选，然后保存该组。",
