"Design a <b>class</b>: the loadout a gladiator fights with. It prints as a class card, like the rulebook’s. Characters pick their class in the Characters tab.":"设计一个<b>职业</b>：角斗士作战所用的装备组。它会像规则书一样印成职业卡。角色在角色页中选择职业。",
"Design a <b>lanista</b>: the face, the house and the temperament. Manager mode’s <b>Create your lanista</b> can start from any lanista on the rolls.":"设计一位<b>Lanista</b>：面孔、家族和性情。经理模式的<b>创建你的Lanista</b>可以从卡池中的任意Lanista开始。",
"Design a <b>tournament</b> for Play Now → New event → 🏆 Tournament. Pick the bracket size, then fill the first-round seats from <b>Your Play Now Gladiators</b> (Main Menu → Annals). Seats you leave open get invited gladiators — lent for this tournament only, never saved. Tick 🎮 on the seats you fight yourself; the rest are played by the computer. {0}":"为立即游戏 → 新赛事 → 🏆 锦标赛设计一场<b>锦标赛</b>。选择对阵规模，然后用<b>你的立即游戏角斗士</b>（主菜单 → Annals）填满第一轮的座位。留空的座位由受邀角斗士补上——只为本次锦标赛借来，从不保存。在你亲自出战的座位上勾选🎮；其余由电脑操控。{0}",
"Design an editor for the framed box: their face, their colors and their <b>voice</b> — what they shout when the blood flows or the fight bores them. Use them for any city (Settings → Editors) or any custom event (Event Designer → Rounds &amp; rules).":"为画框设计一位主办人：脸孔、配色和<b>嗓音</b>——鲜血飞溅或打斗乏味时他们会喊什么。可用于任何城市（设置 → 主办人）或任何自定义赛事（赛事设计器 → 回合与规则）。",
"Design events like the custom events sheet (p.64): player count, rounds with zone and PvE / PvP / CF / CA flags, end conditions, time limits, offering tokens, allowed classes, NPCs and a full board layout with up to 12 pillars, Blessings pots, spikes, tunnels, the chest, Golden Eagles, beasts, offerings, keys, weapons and armor. {0}":"像自定义赛事表（p.64）那样设计赛事：玩家人数、带区域和PvE / PvP / CF / CA设置的回合、结束条件、时间限制、祭品标记、允许的职业、NPC，以及完整的棋盘布局——最多12根柱子、Blessings陶罐、尖刺、通道、宝箱、Golden Eagle、野兽、祭品、钥匙、武器和护甲。{0}",
"Design one in Creator Studio → 🏆 Trophies, or pick from the built-in silverware.":"在创作工坊 → 🏆 奖杯中设计一座，或从内置银器中挑选。",
"Design the <b>invitationals</b> that arrive in Manager mode. Each is a shell: pick the <b>arena</b> (a printed event or one of your Custom Events) and the <b>trophy</b>, then the field, the purse and how often it comes. New ones start off the rolls. The system invitationals sit at the bottom: locked, copy one to make it yours. {0}":"设计在经理模式中到来的<b>邀请赛</b>。每项都是一个框架：选择<b>竞技场</b>（印刷赛事或你的某个自定义赛事）和<b>奖杯</b>，再设定参赛阵容、奖金和举办频率。新的邀请赛起初不在名册上。系统邀请赛在最下方：已锁定，复制一个变成你自己的。{0}",
"Design the <b>special events</b> that arrive as invitations in Manager mode — how often they come, the field, the purse and the prize — and the <b>pairings</b> that make them memorable. The system invitationals sit at the bottom: locked, copy one to make it yours. {0}":"设计在经理模式中以邀请形式到来的<b>特别赛事</b>——多久来一次、参赛阵容、奖金和奖品——以及让它们令人难忘的<b>组合</b>。系统邀请赛在最下方：已锁定，复制一份即可归你所有。{0}",
"Design trophies for your events. A trophy is <b>shape + material + base + topper + gem + inscription</b> — and anything you <b>sculpt</b> on top, with rewards for whoever wins it. Attach one to a custom event in the <b>Event Designer → Rounds &amp; rules</b>: win that event (or its Manager-mode invitational, or its Tournament) and the trophy is yours.":"为你的赛事设计奖杯。奖杯 = <b>造型 + 材质 + 底座 + 顶饰 + 宝石 + 铭文</b>——外加你在上面<b>雕塑</b>的任何东西，并为赢得它的人设定奖励。在<b>赛事设计器 → 回合与规则</b>中把它附加到自定义赛事：赢下该赛事（或它的经理模式邀请赛、或它的锦标赛），奖杯就归你。",
"Design your own beasts for custom events: stats, rewards, behavior (guard a zone, hunt the closest gladiator, or hunt the highest Crowd Favor like Commodus), flight, taming and Initial / Raged / Fazed behavior states. {0}":"为自定义赛事设计你自己的野兽：数值、奖励、行为（守卫区域、猎杀最近的角斗士，或像Commodus那样猎杀观众青睐最高者）、飞行、驯服，以及初始／狂怒／慌乱三种行为状态。{0}",
