"Gladiators whose Fate reached the <b>Ludus Flavius</b> (20+ CF) or freedom live here — up to 92 of them — 32 on the active roster and 60 on the rolls. Once saved, their record updates <b>automatically</b> after every event they are summoned to: survive and the legend grows, fall short and they are struck from the rolls for good. Summon one to fight again (half their final CF up to 25, fresh class gear, severed limbs persist), or continue them as a missio — the five-event campaign of their class.{0}":"Fate达到<b>Ludus Flavius</b>（20+ CF）或获得自由的角斗士住在这里——最多92人——现役名单32人，名册60人。一旦保存，每次被召唤参加赛事后其记录都会<b>自动</b>更新：活下来，传奇就会增长；没达标，就会被永久从名册上划去。召唤一人再战（最终CF的一半，最多25，全新职业装备，断肢保留），或作为missio继续——其职业的五场赛事战役。{0}",
