"League rules follow the <b>Fate table</b> (rulebook p.54-55) for every fighter in every bout, win or lose: under 17 CF they are <b>condemned</b> (Damnatio or a Fatal Charade), 17-19 CF they face the <b>Thumb of Flavius</b> (d6: 4-6 spared, else a d12 picks the death), 20-49 CF they <b>survive</b> to the Ludus Flavius, and 50+ CF earns the <b>rudis</b> — freedom, if they want it. A lanista may pay the editor <b>blood money</b> to buy back a condemned fighter; your own verdicts wait for you on Match Week. Severed limbs persist (−6 rating each) until the priests of Hygeia regrow them; a fighter with two severed limbs retires at the end of the week; the old hang up the sword on their own past 35..":"联赛规则对每场比赛的每名斗士都遵循<b>Fate表</b>（规则书第54-55页），无论胜负：低于17 CF会被<b>定罪</b>（Damnatio或Fatal Charade），17-19 CF面对<b>Thumb of Flavius</b>（d6：4-6饶命，否则由d12决定死法），20-49 CF<b>存活</b>并进入Ludus Flavius，50+ CF赢得<b>rudis</b> — 自由，如果他们想要的话。lanista可以向主办者支付<b>血钱</b>赎回被定罪的斗士；你自己的判决会在比赛周等着你。断肢会一直存在（每条−6属性），直到Hygeia的祭司让其再生；失去两条肢体的斗士在本周结束时退役；年过35的老将会自行挂剑。",
"League rules follow the <b>Fate table</b> (rulebook p.54-55) for every fighter in every bout, win or lose: under {0} they are <b>condemned</b> (Damnatio or a Fatal Charade), 17-19 CF they face the <b>Thumb of Flavius</b> (d6: 4-6 spared, else a d12 picks the death), 20-49 CF they <b>survive</b> to the Ludus Flavius, and 50+ CF earns the <b>rudis</b> — freedom, if they want it. A lanista may pay the editor <b>blood money</b> to buy back a condemned fighter; your own verdicts wait for you on Match Week. Severed limbs persist (−6 rating each) until the priests of Hygeia regrow them; a fighter with two severed limbs retires at the end of the week; the old hang up the sword on their own past 35..":"联赛规则对每场比赛的每名斗士都遵循<b>Fate表</b>（规则书第54-55页），无论胜负：低于{0}会被<b>定罪</b>（Damnatio或Fatal Charade），17-19 CF面对<b>Thumb of Flavius</b>（d6：4-6饶命，否则由d12决定死法），20-49 CF<b>存活</b>并进入Ludus Flavius，50+ CF赢得<b>rudis</b> — 自由，如果他们想要的话。lanista可以向主办者支付<b>血钱</b>赎回被定罪的斗士；你自己的判决会在比赛周等着你。断肢会一直存在（每条−6属性），直到Hygeia的祭司让其再生；失去两条肢体的斗士在本周结束时退役；年过35的老将会自行挂剑。",
