"Run a ludus as its <b>lanista</b>. Recruit fighters the way college coaches recruit: every fighter has an <b>interest</b> level in every ludus, driven by what they want (coin, glory, honor, spectacle, training, home, arena time) and by how your personality and record grade on each. Scout them with sparring bouts simulated in the Ludus, enter them on match nights, bet on the bouts, and poach stars from rival stables. Every bout is a real Flavius Rule event: simulate it instantly or watch it live on the board. And mind the books — three week-ends in the red, or a season ended in debt, and the creditors close the ludus <b>for good</b>.":"以<b>lanista</b>的身份经营一座ludus。像大学教练招募球员那样招募斗士：每名斗士对每座ludus都有一个<b>兴趣</b>值，取决于他们想要什么（金币、荣耀、荣誉、场面、训练、家乡、出场机会），以及你的性格和战绩在每一项上的评分。在Ludus中通过模拟对练来侦察他们，在比赛之夜让他们出场，为比赛下注，并从对手的角斗士团挖走明星。每场比赛都是真正的Flavius Rule赛事：立即模拟，或在棋盘上实时观看。还要当心账目——连续三个周末赤字，或负债结束一个赛季，债主就会<b>永久</b>关闭ludus。",
"Runs the smallest arena in the league and the loudest crowd in it. Recruits fishermen, and they fight like it.":"经营联赛中最小的竞技场，拥有其中最吵的观众。招募渔夫，他们打起来也像渔夫。",
