"The 20% cut from bouts":"比赛中20%的分成",
"The 3D minis replace the standees; the pillars are shorter and wear the painted stone of his pillar standee":"3D微缩模型取代立牌；柱子更矮，披上了他柱子立牌的彩绘石纹",
"The 3D minis turn to face where they move":"3D微缩模型会转向移动方向",
"The <b>Acta Diurna</b> — the week's gazette: results, deaths, signings, the league's top fives. When you have read it, <b>set the paper down</b> to finish this lesson.":"<b>Acta Diurna</b>——本周公报：结果、死亡、签约、联赛前五。读完后<b>放下报纸</b>即可结束本课程。",
"The <b>Banner press</b> — the same press that prints every banner in the empire. The order of cloth: <b>one banner for the empire</b>, <b>one for each city</b> (its spectators and its guard rep it), <b>one per ludus</b> (yours flies on the masthead, the league table, the square and the stands), and every gladiator is born under a <b>family banner</b> shared with their kin. Design a house banner here and it hangs in the banner rack whenever a lanista is created.":"<b>旗帜印坊</b>——印制帝国每一面旗帜的同一座印坊。布的次序：<b>帝国一面旗</b>，<b>每座城市一面</b>（由其观众和卫兵代表），<b>每个Ludus一面</b>（你的飘扬在报头、联赛积分榜、广场和看台上），而每名角斗士都生于与亲属共用的<b>家族旗帜</b>之下。在这里设计家族旗帜，每当创建Lanista时它就会挂在旗架上。",
"The <b>Fate table applies</b> after every heat, as in any bout — thumbs, blood money and the rudis wait for you below.":"每场预赛后<b>都要查Fate表</b>，与任何比赛一样——拇指、血钱和rudis在下面等着你。",
"The <b>Feature bout</b>. You do have a fighter who could go in — {0} — but we are saving them for the <b>Main event</b>. So <b>bet</b> on this one instead: raise your stake with <b>+5</b>.":"<b>焦点赛</b>。你确实有一名斗士可以上场——{0}——但我们要把其留给<b>主赛</b>。所以这场改为<b>下注</b>：用<b>+5</b>提高你的赌注。",
"The <b>Liberti</b>: gladiators who won an event with <b>50+ Crowd Favor</b> and took the <b>rudis</b> — the wooden sword of freedom — instead of returning to the Ludus. They have left the sands, and the game, forever. Only their glory remains.":"<b>Liberti</b>：以<b>50+观众青睐</b>赢下赛事、并领取<b>rudis</b>——象征自由的木剑——而不是回到Ludus的角斗士。他们已永远离开了沙场和这个游戏。只有荣耀留存。",
"The <b>Main event</b> — the big purse. Pick <b>{0}</b> and press <b>Enter your fighter</b>.":"<b>主赛</b>——大奖金。选择<b>{0}</b>，按<b>派斗士参赛</b>。",
"The <b>editor of the games</b> is the face in the framed box over the arena — the one who pays for the games, and the rulebook's own word for them. Flavius edits every city's games to begin with; <b>win a match as a human player</b> at a city and its own editor is <b>unlocked</b> — pick them for that city below to seat them in the box (and their name replaces Flavius in the herald’s lines). Win at all twelve and the <b>Editor creator</b> opens in the Creator Studio.":"<b>赛会主办人</b>就是竞技场上方画框里的那张脸——为赛会出钱的人，也是规则书本身对他们的称呼。起初每座城市的赛会都由Flavius主办；在某座城市<b>以真人玩家身份赢下一场比赛</b>，该城自己的主办人就会<b>解锁</b>——在下方为那座城市选择他们，让其坐进画框（传令官台词中的Flavius也会换成他们的名字）。在全部十二座城市获胜后，创作工坊中的<b>主办人创作器</b>就会开放。",
"The <b>only</b> way to regrow a severed limb":"让断肢再生的<b>唯一</b>办法",
"The <b>tabs</b> run your ludus — your house, the arena, the wider world, and you. Work them left to right each week; the coach will walk you through them.":"<b>分页</b>用来经营你的Ludus——你的家族、竞技场、外面的世界，还有你自己。每周从左到右处理一遍；教练会带你走一遍。",
"The <b>top 20</b> Fate scores of <b>{0}</b>, ordered by final Crowd Favor. The board resets at the start of every month ({1} day{2} left); each month's best is kept below as its champion. RR is the Royal Reserve; FF marks Flavius Fidelis (a revealed Mandata Flavi). Custom characters and custom events are not eligible.{3}":"<b>{0}</b>的Fate分数<b>前20名</b>，按最终观众青睐排序。榜单每月初重置（还剩{1}天{2||}）；每月的最高分作为当月冠军保留在下方。RR是Royal Reserve；FF表示Flavius Fidelis（已公开的Mandata Flavi）。自定义角色和自定义赛事不计入。{3}",
"The Acta Diurna is nailed to the forum wall at week's end. Complaints may be addressed to the editor, who does not read them.":"Acta Diurna于每周末钉在广场的墙上。投诉请寄给编辑，他不看。",
