"The sand is not empty: <b>{0}</b>{1} is still running on the board — there is only one arena, and Manager mode needs it.":"沙场并不空：<b>{0}</b>{1}仍在棋盘上进行——竞技场只有一个，而经理模式需要它。",
"The sand is packed hard on the east side — pillars topple toward the tunnels.":"东侧的沙子压得很实——柱子会朝通道方向倒下。",
