"The sand is raked smooth, the ropes come down to open the full square, the pillars stand dressed, and the beast gates are barred. The arena waits for its next games.":"沙子被耙平，绳子撤下，整个场地完全敞开，柱子整装待命，兽门也已闩上。竞技场在等待下一场比赛。",
"The sand is wide enough for both of us. Usually.":"沙场够我们两家用的。通常是。",
"The sand keeps what it is given. <b>{0}</b>, {1}{2}{3}{4}, died this week — {5}. The record they leave: {6} event{7}, {8} win{9}, {10} kill{11}. {12}{13}":"沙场从不归还它得到的东西。<b>{0}</b>（{1}{2}{3}{4}）本周死去——{5}。其留下的战绩：{6}场赛事{7||}，{8}场胜利{9||}，{10}次击杀{11||}。{12}{13}",
"The sand looks lived in: 3D spike caps, the Arena Chest as on its token, 3D pots, sand grain and old scars":"沙场更有生活气息：3D尖刺盖、与标记一致的Arena Chest、3D罐子、沙粒纹理和旧伤痕",
"The sand remembers the house, and so do the bookmakers.":"沙场记得这个家族，庄家们也记得。",
"The sand waits.":"沙场在等待。",
"The sand went hungry. Remarkable.":"沙场饿着肚子。真是难得。",
"The sand will remember this one.":"沙场会记住这一刻。",
