"The sea takes them all, in the end.":"大海最终会带走所有人。",
"The season":"赛季",
"The season closes and one name is on every tongue: <b>{0}</b> of {1}, fame {2} ({3}), record {4}–{5}. {6} A new season begins next week, and every reputation is again for rent.":"赛季落幕，人人都在念叨同一个名字：{1}的<b>{0}</b>，名望{2}（{3}），战绩{4}–{5}。{6} 新赛季下周开始，所有名声又一次待价而沽。",
"The season's great final — Flavius's own games. When week 12 ends, the top four of the league table (points: a win 3, a runner-up finish 1) each send one fighter to Roma; the league pauses while you watch it live or play it out, and then the Flavian Awards are handed out.{0}":"赛季的盛大决赛 — Flavius自己的比赛。第12周结束时，联赛积分榜（胜利3分，亚军1分）前四名各派一名斗士前往Roma；你直播观看或亲自参赛期间联赛暂停，之后颁发Flavian Awards。{0}",
"The season's schedule":"赛季赛程",
"The season’s championship in Roma for the top four houses. The awards, the recap paper and the [[ledger|Quaestor’s Ledger]] follow it.":"赛季冠军赛在Roma举行，由前四名家族参加。之后是颁奖、回顾报和[[ledger|财务官账簿]]。",
"The season’s pay to every house: a stipend, tax returns, bounties, [[fame]] and league finish. Thriving houses get no stipend.":"赛季结束时付给每个家族的钱：津贴、退税、赏金、[[fame|名望]]和联赛名次。兴旺的家族没有津贴。",
"The second bout of the week is fought after dusk, under the torches. The rules are the same.":"每周第二场比赛在黄昏后、火把下进行。规则不变。",
