"What a rating does on the sand: it sets how well the fighter plays (below 60 like an Easy CPU with loose, noisy decisions; 60-79 Normal; 80+ Hard, near-perfect choices), the armor fitted before the bout (+1 AP per 6 points above 62, up to +5) and coin in the purse (+1 per 5 points above 70, up to +4). Morale shifts it: high morale adds 1 AP and a CF, low morale takes an AP, broken morale drops a skill tier. Injuries and severed limbs lower the rating itself.":"属性在沙场上的作用：决定斗士的表现（低于60像简单难度的CPU，决策松散多误；60-79普通；80+困难，选择近乎完美）、比赛前配备的护甲（高于62每6点+1 AP，最多+5）以及奖金中的金币（高于70每5点+1，最多+4）。士气会影响它：高士气+1 AP和1点CF，低士气−1 AP，士气崩溃降低一个技能等级。伤势和断肢会降低属性本身。",
