"“<b>{0}</b> has put <b>{1}</b> a week on the table for <b>{2}</b>. Answer by the week's end, or the fighter is theirs.”":"「<b>{0}</b>为<b>{2}</b>开出了每周<b>{1}</b>的价码。本周结束前答复，否则这名斗士就归他们了。」",
"“Ask the sausage guy,” they say. The sausage guy also declines.":"「去问卖香肠的吧，」他们说。卖香肠的也拒绝了。",
"“Back in my day we fought lions with our bare hands. Then the lions won, mostly.”":"「想当年我们赤手空拳跟狮子搏斗。然后嘛，大多是狮子赢了。」",
"“Citizens of {0}! By the generosity of the editor, <b>FLAVIUS</b>, we present {1}{2}! {3}!”":"「{0}的公民们！承蒙主办者<b>FLAVIUS</b>慷慨，我们呈上{1}{2}！{3}！」",
"“I bet on the underdog every week. The underdog owes me a house.”":"「我每周都押冷门。冷门欠我一栋房子。」",
"“I have fought for this house, bled for it, saved every coin it paid me. Sell it to me, lanista. I will keep the name, keep the fighters — and pay you <b>{0} coin</b>.”":"“我为这个家族战斗、流血，攒下了它付给我的每一个金币。把它卖给我吧，Lanista。我会保留名号，留下斗士——并付你<b>{0}金币</b>。”",
"“I have fought for this house, bled for it, saved every coin it paid me. Sell it to me, lanista. I will keep the name, keep the fighters — and pay you <b>{0}</b>.”":"「我为这个家族战斗、流血，攒下了它付给我的每一枚金币。把它卖给我吧，lanista。我会保留这个名字，保留这些斗士 — 并付给你<b>{0}</b>。」",
"“I told my wife {0} would win. She said I should get a job. We are both right.”":"「我跟老婆说{0}会赢。她说我该去找份工作。我们俩都对。」",
"“If they fall” subtracts 5 CF per unrevealed Mandata Flavi. “If they win” adds the event reward, 5 CF per 3 trophies and 2 CF per Flavius item.":"「如果倒下」按每张未公开的Mandata Flavi扣5 CF。「如果获胜」加上赛事奖励、每3个奖杯5 CF、每件Flavius物品2 CF。",
"“If they fall” subtracts {0} per unrevealed Mandata Flavi. “If they win” adds the event reward, {1} per 3 trophies and {2} per Flavius item.":"「如果倒下」每张未揭晓的Mandata Flavi扣{0}。「如果获胜」加上赛事奖励、每3个战利品{1}和每件Flavius物品{2}。",
"“I’ve SEEN what happens down there,” they explain, gesturing at the sand.":"「我可是亲眼见过下面会发生什么的，」他们指着沙场解释道。",
"“My cousin's neighbor's ludus is the best in the empire. I have never been.”":"「我表兄邻居的ludus是全帝国最好的。我一次都没去过。」",
"“My mother didn’t raise a trophy,” they say, not unkindly.":"「我妈可没把我养大去当奖杯，」他们说，语气倒不刻薄。",
"“No house will look at me. Take me on and I’ll pay you <b>{0} coin</b> — give me the sand and I’ll give you a name.”":"“没有家族愿意看我一眼。收下我，我付你<b>{0}金币</b>——给我沙场，我给你一个名号。”",
"“No house will look at me. Take me on and I’ll pay you <b>{0}</b> — give me the sand and I’ll give you a name.”":"「没有家族肯看我一眼。收下我，我付你<b>{0}</b> — 给我沙场，我给你名声。」",
