"“Put one of yours against one of ours this week. The winner's house takes the purse twice.”":"“本周让你的人和我们的人打一场。胜方家族拿走双倍奖金。”",
"“Sound the horns” no longer drops you back at the main menu":"“吹响号角”不再把你丢回主菜单",
"“Speak the word, and doors open.”":"「说出那个词，门便会打开。」",
"“The editor looked right at me when the thumb went down. I left early.”":"「拇指朝下的时候，主办人正盯着我看。我提前走了。」",
"“The people did not come to watch friendship!” <b>The thumb turns down.</b> Each survivor is executed, their death drawn from the d12 of the Fates.":"「人民不是来看友谊的！」<b>拇指朝下。</b>每名幸存者都被处决，死法由Fates的d12抽出。",
"“The sausages at {0} are a crime. I would know. I sell them.”":"「{0}的香肠简直是犯罪。我很清楚。我就是卖香肠的。」",
"“This feud costs us both. Let it rest.”":"“这场宿怨让我们两败俱伤。就此作罢吧。”",
"“Tholo winked at me. I think. It only has the one eye, so it's hard to tell.”":"「Tholo冲我眨了眨眼。我觉得是。它只有一只眼睛，所以很难说。」",
"“Three wins in a row — <b>{0}</b> is the talk of the baths. Let my name ride on that shield.”":"「三连胜 — <b>{0}</b>成了浴场里的话题。让我的名字也挂在那面盾牌上吧。」",
"“To bear this worthily is good fortune”":"“配得上这份好运，便是好运”",
