"🎟 <b>Spectating is back — everywhere.</b> In Play now, with every seat CPU, <b>Play as a spectator</b> seats you in the stands before the horns (the crowd is filled in if you had none). During any match with no fighter of yours standing — none entered, or yours has fallen — <b>🎟 Buy a ticket</b> seats you mid-bout, paid from the active wallet (general admission 4 coin, not counted as betting). Each rotation you earn 1 CF and may throw stones or offerings, change sections or join a chant for Tholo.":"🎟 <b>观战回归——随处可用。</b>在立即游戏中，所有座位为CPU时，<b>以观众身份游玩</b>会在号角前让你坐进看台（如果没有观众会自动填满）。在任何没有你的斗士在场的比赛中——没有报名，或已阵亡——<b>🎟 买票</b>可在比赛中途入座，从当前钱包支付（普通门票4金币，不计为投注）。每轮你获得1 CF，可投石或献祭、换区，或加入为Tholo的呐喊。",
