"🏟 <b>The practice arena.</b> Request an <b>exhibition</b> from a rival stable: your fighter against theirs, sparring partners filling the Classic Elimination's four places. <b>Nobody dies</b> — the doctors pull a fighter before the killing blow and the bout is called. The stands fill with fighters from around the league, who pay a coin from their own purses to watch. You get their fighters fully scouted, a training chance for yours (better if they last), <b>a Match Week edge</b> this week (+1 AP, +2 CF), the gate money, a perk point, and warmer relations with that lanista. {0} hours and {1} coin each; once per fighter per week.":"🏟 <b>练习竞技场。</b>向一个宿敌家族申请<b>表演赛</b>：你的斗士对阵他们的斗士，陪练填满Classic Elimination的四个位置。<b>没有人会死</b> — 医生会在致命一击前把斗士拉开，比赛随即叫停。看台上坐满了联赛各地的斗士，他们自掏腰包花一枚金币来观看。你能完全侦察对方的斗士，为自己的斗士赢得训练机会（坚持越久越好），本周获得<b>比赛周优势</b>（+1 AP，+2 CF），以及门票收入、一个天赋点，并改善与那位lanista的关系。每次{0}小时和{1}金币；每名斗士每周一次。",
