"🦅 <b>The show goes on.</b> On the main menu, after the Damnatio is hauled off, the base beasts come for the rest: the eagle drops from above, the bear rises from behind, wolves and snakes come in from the front, and Tholo reaches out of the shadows. With the sand empty, <b>Commodus</b> strides in and raises his sword as laurels and flowers rain at his feet — and now and then a gladiator comes back, fights him in a cloud of dust, and kneels over his body.":"🦅 <b>表演继续。</b>在主菜单上，Damnatio被拖走之后，基础野兽前来收场：鹰从天而降，熊从后方起身，狼和蛇从前方进场，Tholo从阴影中伸出手来。沙场清空后，<b>Commodus</b>大步走入，在如雨的桂冠和鲜花中举起他的剑——偶尔还会有一名角斗士归来，在漫天尘土中与他决斗，并跪在他的尸体旁。",
