"🧭 <b>The full-screen split.</b> Manager mode and the Creator Studio no longer squeeze every tab into one row. In full screen they sit in a grouped <b>left rail</b>: Manager as <b>Ludus</b> (your ludus, roster, recruiting, favorites, infirmary, practice), <b>Arena</b> (Match Week, wagers), <b>World</b> (news, league, Imperium, trophies, season) and <b>Lanista</b>, with ⏭ End the week under the rail; the Studio as <b>Overview</b>, <b>Fighters</b> (characters, beasts, tokens), <b>Gear</b> (weapons &amp; armor, trophies, banners), <b>Arena</b> (events, editors, spectators) and <b>Tools</b>. The chosen tab fills the rest of the screen. In a small window the familiar row of tabs returns. Match Week and the live bout are unchanged.":"🧭 <b>全屏分栏。</b>经理模式和创作工坊不再把所有标签页挤在一行。全屏时它们位于分组的<b>左侧栏</b>：经理模式分为<b>Ludus</b>（你的ludus、名单、招募、收藏、医务所、练习）、<b>竞技场</b>（比赛周、赌注）、<b>世界</b>（新闻、联赛、Imperium、奖杯、赛季）和<b>Lanista</b>，侧栏下方是⏭ 结束本周；工坊分为<b>概览</b>、<b>斗士</b>（角色、野兽、棋子）、<b>装备</b>（武器 &amp; 护甲、奖杯、横幅）、<b>竞技场</b>（赛事、主办者、观众）和<b>工具</b>。所选的标签页占满屏幕其余部分。在小窗口中会恢复熟悉的一行标签页。比赛周和直播比赛不变。",
